Contains the preprocessing pipeline package used:
- cleaning.py --> cleans and standardizes NTSB & METAR dataset, drops unecessary columns, and adds crosswind and tailwind components for weather.
- eda.py --> performs basic exploratory data analysis (EDA) to understand relationships and data structure.
- feature_engineering.py --> selects top features through Mutual Information (MI) feature selection and Conditional Mutual Information (CMI) selection.
- visualization --> histograms and bar plots that visualize relationships amongst variables.
